# Working files that are not this repository's to carry.
#
# THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC, and everything below was untracked - which is a
# fragile kind of safe, one `git add -A` from being published.
#
# `lovable/` is the design-adaptation prompt set. `todos.md` is a scratch list.
# The loose PNGs at the root are payment-system and machine reference shots
# dropped in for reference rather than added to `public/`. None of them is part
# of the site, and none of them should be the thing a visitor to the repo finds.
lovable/
todos.md
/*.png
/*.pdf

# Research and client correspondence.
#
# THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC. `docs/` holds the SEO keyword and competitor
# research, the competitor backlink analysis, the sale-price research with its
# provenance, the decisions log and the numbered Q&A rounds with the client.
# That is the commercial advantage this project was built on, plus one side of a
# client conversation - and it was one `git add -A` away from being published.
#
# The files stay on disk and are used; they are simply not this repo's to carry.
# If they should be version-controlled, put them in one of the private repos
# (buy-a-vend or sell-a-vend), not here.
docs/
